<CaseStudy
  title="A metal fabrication shop, rebuilt around AI"
  description="A Nashville-area metals business: a shop that sells metal cut to length and does welding, railings, gates, stairs and repairs. The owner wanted customers to be able to find, price and order without him on the phone for every job."
